title: "GenAI & Agentic AI Security Incidents"
message: >-
  If you use this dataset in research, tooling, training, or policy work,
  please cite it as below. Cite this repository (the preferred-citation
  below) for aggregate or dataset-wide use. For an individual incident,
  cite that incident's own primary source instead, not this repository —
  every rendered incident links to it. The DOI below is Zenodo's concept
  DOI, which always resolves to the latest release; cite a release's own
  version DOI only when deliberately pinning to that specific version.
