  - "OWASP LLM Top 10"
  - "OWASP Agentic Top 10"
  - "MITRE ATLAS"
  - "NIST AI RMF"
  - "AI incident database"
abstract: >-
  A continuously-maintained, consolidated index of publicly disclosed
  GenAI and agentic-AI security incidents, vulnerabilities, and red-team
  findings. Every applicable entry is mapped to four core taxonomies:
  OWASP Top 10 for LLM Applications (2026), OWASP Agentic Top 10 (ASI),
  NIST AI Risk Management Framework (AI 100-1), and MITRE ATLAS. A
  companion MAESTRO architectural-layer mapping is carried where the
  source provides it, and an experimental VERIS 1.4.1 crosswalk is
  computed at export time. Aggregated from AIID, OECD AIM, AIAAIC, MITRE
  ATLAS, AVID, MIT FutureTech AI Risk Navigator, NVD/GHSA/OSV, garak,
  promptfoo, and dozens of researcher blogs and vendor threat reports.
